/* Search, then a horizontal facet bar, then the results and the grid - a single column
   rather than the facet rail this started as. The rail made sense when the catalog was a
   full-width page of its own; inside the docs shell it sat immediately beside the docs
   sidebar, so the page opened with two vertical columns of navigation competing for the
   same glance, and the card grid lost the width to a rail whose thirteen checkboxes only
   ever needed one line. */
.cat {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
